{"ordinal":13663,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395208","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Death_07a3a21","source":"Cold: Я, кажется, понял, почему мне так холодно.","target":"Cold: Cred că am înțeles de ce mi-e atât de frig.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13664,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395207","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Death_016c305","source":"Cold: Знаешь...","target":"Cold: Știi...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13665,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395206","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_DontShoot_02e3929","source":"Cold: Наверно, это лишнее.","target":"Cold: Poate nu era cazul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13666,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395205","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_DontShoot_08c940a","source":"Cold: Просто подумал, почему бы тебя не спросить что-то такое.","target":"Cold: M-am gândit doar că aș putea să te întreb ceva de genul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13667,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395204","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_DontShoot_001f90b","source":"Cold: Ты можешь их игнорировать.","target":"Cold: Poți să le ignori.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13668,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395203","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_DontShoot_00c6619","source":"Cold: Прости, наверно, я задаю слишком личные вопросы иногда.","target":"Cold: Iartă-mă, probabil pun uneori întrebări prea personale.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13669,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395202","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_DontShoot_098f0b7","source":"Cold: ...","target":"Cold: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13670,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395201","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Photo_DontShoot_0baac1e","source":"Cold: Или это было всё же не обязательно?","target":"Cold: Sau poate că totuși nu era nevoie?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13671,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452761395200","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Photo_DontShoot_0c64550","source":"Cold: Почему надо обязательно кого-то убивать?","target":"Cold: De ce trebuie neapărat să omori pe cineva?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13672,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200904","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Photo_DontShoot_08661e7","source":"Cold: Как ты думаешь? Сколько еще признаков придумают, прежде чем поймут, что нужно вообще делать?","target":"Cold: Tu ce crezi? Câte semne or să mai inventeze înainte să înțeleagă ce trebuie făcut de fapt?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13673,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200903","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_DontShoot_0460fc6","source":"Cold: Кстати, да, это было довольно холодно. Я про снятие куртки.","target":"Cold: Apropo, da, mi-a fost destul de frig. Mă refer la momentul când mi-am scos geaca.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13674,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200902","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_DontShoot_0da6e75","source":"Cold: Когда никто не грозил убить нас. Можно было выйти днём на улицу.","target":"Cold: Când nimeni nu amenința să ne omoare. Puteai ieși pe stradă ziua.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13675,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200901","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_DontShoot_09dbadc","source":"Cold: Когда не было вероятности вымереть как вид.","target":"Cold: Când nu riscam să dispărem ca specie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13676,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200900","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_DontShoot_0fa98a5","source":"Cold: Знаешь, я соскучился по тихой спокойной жизни.","target":"Cold: Știi, mi-e dor de o viață liniștită și pașnică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13677,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200899","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_DontShoot_09f1bdd","source":"Cold: И я не могу ни с кем сблизиться. Это влечет только страдания. И настоящую боль.","target":"Cold: Și nu mă pot apropia de nimeni. Asta aduce doar suferință. Și durere adevărată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13678,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200898","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_DontShoot_0b46bb4","source":"Cold: Их наполняет только бесконечное одиночество.","target":"Cold: Sunt plini doar de o singurătate fără sfârșit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13679,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200897","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_DontShoot_03bb3cc","source":"Cold: Жизнь давно ушла из моих глаз.","target":"Cold: Viața a dispărut de mult din ochii mei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13680,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452757200896","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_DontShoot_08ccd01","source":"Cold: Почему так? Не задумывался?","target":"Cold: De ce oare? Nu te-ai gândit?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13681,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006597","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_DontShoot_021a3d7","source":"Cold: А в это время в других домах кто-то кого-то убил, наверно.","target":"Cold: Și între timp, în alte case, probabil că cineva a omorât pe altcineva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13682,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006596","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_DontShoot_0a4b49c","source":"Cold: Но ты решил не убивать меня.","target":"Cold: Dar tu ai hotărât să nu mă omori.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13683,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006595","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_DontShoot_0e7ad30","source":"Cold: Знаешь, я уже так устал жить.","target":"Cold: Știi, sunt deja atât de obosit de viață.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13684,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006594","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_DontShoot_08518fc","source":"Cold: Меня кое-что гложет, но я пока не могу тебе открыться, извини.","target":"Cold: Mă macină ceva, dar încă nu pot să-ți vorbesc despre asta. Iartă-mă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13685,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006593","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_DontShoot_065cf3d","source":"Cold: Надеюсь, смогу быть полезен.","target":"Cold: Sper să-ți pot fi de folos.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13686,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452753006592","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_DontShoot_0edf1bb","source":"Cold: Спасибо за доверие.","target":"Cold: Mulțumesc pentru încredere.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-348.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
