{"ordinal":13694,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452744617987","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Photo_Gun_0b32926","source":"Cold: Я могу оставить фотографию себе? Меня не фоткали до этого.","target":"Cold: Pot păstra fotografia? Nimeni nu mi-a mai făcut poze până acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13695,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452744617986","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_Gun_0a2dbce","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13696,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452744617985","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_Gun_0d27409","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13697,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452744617984","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_Gun_0eebda8","source":"Cold: Организм с чем-то борется, но это бестолковая борьба.","target":"Cold: Corpul meu luptă cu ceva, dar lupta asta e zadarnică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13698,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423687","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Armpit_Gun_07cfdd6","source":"Cold: Там грибок? Наверно, из-за того, что я всё же потею под курткой.","target":"Cold: E vreo ciupercă acolo? Probabil fiindcă totuși transpir sub geacă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13699,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423686","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_Gun_075867c","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13700,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423685","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_Gun_0b6b116","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13701,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423684","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_Gun_04e7f05","source":"Cold: Тогда просто не медли, прошу. Ожидание хуже смерти.","target":"Cold: Atunci nu mai zăbovi, te rog. Așteptarea e mai rea decât moartea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13702,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423683","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Eyes_Gun_0c8e15d","source":"Cold: Это в тебе говорит жажда убийств? Ведь у меня не красные глаза.","target":"Cold: Vorbește setea de a ucide din tine? Doar nu am ochii roșii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13703,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423682","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_Gun_00cf099","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13704,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_Gun_0c0b36d","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13705,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452740423680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_Gun_0037427","source":"Cold: Я бы хотел тебе рассказать кое-что. Но мне страшно.","target":"Cold: Aș vrea să-ți spun ceva. Dar mi-e frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13706,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229385","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_Gun_07d1b4a","source":"Cold: Прости, что прошу об этом, но... если можешь, не стреляй пока что.","target":"Cold: Iartă-mă că-ți cer asta, dar… dacă poți, nu trage încă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13707,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229384","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Hands_Gun_0cb0f68","source":"Cold: Да, мои руки особо не проверишь на признаки Гостя в таком состоянии.","target":"Cold: Da, în starea asta mâinile mele nu prea pot fi verificate pentru semnele unui Musafir.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13708,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229383","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_Gun_0742fb3","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13709,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229382","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_Gun_015938a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13710,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229381","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Teeth_Gun_02fe035","source":"Cold: Но, похоже, скоро напоминать об этом будет не за чем.","target":"Cold: Dar se pare că, în curând, n-o să mai aibă rost să-ți amintesc asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-349.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13711,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229380","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_0eda1eb","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13712,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452736229379","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_03a6b7d","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
