{"ordinal":13716,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452732035080","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Cold_Ears_06b59e8","source":"Cold: Всё наше тело - это сплошные дыры.","target":"Cold: Întregul nostru trup e plin de găuri.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-350.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
